    "detailed_description": "<strong>Mission Twentynine</strong> is an action hack and slash. Defeat enemies and upgrade your character to suit any playstyle you could possibly wish for.<br>Do you want weaponry that will blow up any enemy to pieces? Or are you the type of person who prefers putting down a turret or two and watching your creations do the destruction for you? Perhaps you wish to be a dual wielding samurai, or why not all of them at once?<br><br>Whatever you want, you can do.<br><br>Mission Twentynine features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Close to an infinite* combinations of upgrades and weapons to make each run truly unique and to your own liking.<br></li><li> Large variety of enemies in all shapes of sizes.<br></li><li> Weapons.<br></li><li> Explosions.<br></li><li> You</li></ul><br>Oh yes.. There will be screenshake**<br><br><br><br>*Way less than infinite <br>**You can turn off screenshake if you wish",
